      "tpd_week": "主題一",
      "tpd_reading": "<div><strong>Fundamnetal of Consumer Behavior</strong></div>\n\n<div><strong>消費者行為基礎</strong></div>\n",
      "tpd_reading_en": " ",
      "tpd_learn": "<div>The first part of this class mainly focused on some fundamental concepts or theories of consumer behavior.</div>\n\n<div>此課程主題一主要聚焦在消費者行為的基礎概念或是後關裡論。</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>The topics and theories picked&nbsp;up by Lecturer 1 include (but are not limited to)</div>\n\n<ol>\n\t<li>Introduciton of consumer reserach</li>\n\t<li>Consumer 1, 2, 3</li>\n\t<li>Consumer Decision</li>\n\t<li>Micro factors that affect consumer behavior</li>\n\t<li>Macro factors that affect consumer behavior</li>\n</ol>\n\n<div>主題一授課教師所挑選的概念或是理論主要包含（但不限於)</div>\n\n<ol>\n\t<li>消費者行為簡介</li>\n\t<li>消費者1,2,3</li>\n\t<li>消費者決策</li>\n\t<li>影響消費者行為的個體因素</li>\n\t<li>影響消費者行為的總體因素</li>\n</ol>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n",
